SpecQR Kotlin
Copyright (c) 2026 SpecQR

From-scratch Kotlin/JVM QR Code Model 2 implementation based on the
user-owned SpecQR algorithm and API contracts. Runtime source is Kotlin;
it does not wrap or depend on SpecQR Java or third-party QR libraries.

QR structure, encoding and Reed-Solomon tables implement published QR
Code Model 2 parameters. The fixed Kanji mapping follows the WHATWG
Encoding Standard Shift_JIS index first-mapping behavior.

Kotlin standard library and a JDK are language/platform dependencies.
Test-only independent QR encoders and decoders are not shipped in the JAR.
